  "summary": "editable-contracts preinstall drops Bun runtime and executes obfuscated sibling payload",
  "details": "Package advertises itself as a React JSON form library but its preinstall hook (`node setup.mjs`) downloads the Bun runtime from GitHub releases for the current OS/arch, extracts it to a temp path, chmods it executable, and invokes it against a bundled sibling file `math_init.js` (~728 KB, single-line, heavily obfuscated with a shuffled numeric string-array and mangled identifiers). The Bun-run payload is unrelated to the stated purpose of the package and its content is not inspectable by Node-based tooling. Installing the package auto-executes this obfuscated payload on the host at `npm install` time.",
